#Lab enviroment

## Objective

The objective of this is to set up the virtual machinces for this lab.
This project will use a Windows 11 vm for blue team testing and Kali Linux vm for red team testing.

## Virtual Machines

|VM Name | Operating System | Role | CPU | Ram | Storage |
|Sentinel| Windows 11 | Blue Team | 4 CPU | 5000mb | 80GB |
|Raider| Kali Linux | Red Team | 3 CPU | 6000mb | 10GB |

## Windows VM Setup

- Downloaded Windows ISO 
- In VirtualBox select New\
- VM Name, mount ISO in ISO Image, verifiy OS and OS Version
- set Username and password
- Finish settings seen above
- VM downloads and boots.


